config BR2_PACKAGE_JETHOME_BURN
	 bool "jethome-burn"
	 help
	   This package installs the jethome-tools tree, which the post-image
	   step uses to build Amlogic USB-burn images.

	   The board is selected by BURN_BOARD in the board meta file
	   not here, so that the burn board name has a
	   single source of truth next to BOARD_ID.

	   https://github.com/jethome-iot/jethome-tools
